WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
This is a story about the instant noodles sent from heaven, also known as GreeNoodle.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.560
Our story starts with the lesser known vegetable known as moroheiya.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.580
This vegetable is rich in iron, calcium, vitamin C and beta carotene,

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:17.040
contains more than 32 vitamins and minerals, and has a potent antioxidant capability.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.280
When placed side by side with other traditional vegetables, moroheiya comes out on top in nearly every category.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.060
It has twice the dietary fiber and five times the calcium of spinach,

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:30.900
and it even has 50% more beta carotene than carrots, even though carrots are named after beta carotene.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.160
This discovery traces back to Ancient Egypt,

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.400
where it is rumored that Cleopatra used it as a secret to her beauty,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.720
and it was used to restore the health of a dying pharaoh.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:43.600
A Japanese man named Mr. Sho Oga saw this plant and was amazed at its health benefits.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.140
He began thinking about how to turn this plant into a healthy product that anyone,

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:48.620
even children, could enjoy.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:52.140
It was difficult because moroheiya has a sticky texture similar to okra,

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:52.820
which many people don't like.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:57.020
But he discovered that by kneading the moroheiya into noodles, the stickiness actually

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.960
gave the noodles a pleasantly chewy texture,

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.840
and thus GreeNoodle was born.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.700
GreeNoodle combines the delicious taste of instant ramen noodles

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.040
with the exceptional nutritional value of moroheiya.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.360
A single package gives you nearly 50% of the

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.920
fiber needed by your body daily.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:14.120
It contains components of mucin, which helps protect the mucosa of digestive organs,

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.400
preventing indigestion.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.660
Other instant ramen products fill their soup base

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:18.840
with artificial products such as

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:21.120
preservatives, MSG and food coloring.

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.101
The noodles are usually fried before drying them,

00:01:23.101 --> 00:01:24.840
which means there's oil in the noodles that

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.000
can become oxidized,

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.180
which is extremely bad for the body once ingested.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.800
GreeNoodles contain none of these,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.540
and in addition they are air dried instead of fried,

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.740
which allows for much higher retention of nutrients.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:38.160
Parents who struggle to get their kids to eat their vegetables can struggle no more.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.900
GreeNoodle is healthy, delicious and only takes three easy minutes to cook.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:44.400
It can also be enjoyed in a refreshing noodle salad,

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.080
or as a warm comforting meal with your favorite pasta sauce.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.380
The possibilities of your own creations are endless.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.000
It's the instant noodles sent from heaven!

